          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Access should be documented before it is needed.</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Nobody finds out who controls a registrar account at a convenient moment. The right time to discover a missing login is during a routine review, not at 11pm on go-live day.</p>
